t(20, 745, """I am the best of mankind .. I am the best of people .. I am the finest of mankind .. the most righteous of them .. I use visions to accuse people of being corrupt .. I do not see my own calamities .. nor my own disasters .. nor my shortcomings toward Allah .. I do not see my own reality .. But I decided to use my channel to tell people that so-and-so is righteous and so-and-so is wicked on the basis of visions that come to me .. I decided to interfere in people's Hereafter .. I classify them not by their deeds nor by their words .. but by visions that come to me .. I classify them as hypocrites and liars not because they did anything bad .. but from visions that come to me and suit my own whims in my hatred of this one and my loathing of that one .. So I tell people that so-and-so is a liar and a hypocrite and that so-and-so is acting righteous before you, because I hate him and cannot stand him .. People ask me: What did he do? I say: He did every good thing, but he is acting! People ask me: How did you know he is acting? Is there any proof? I say: Visions came to me and told me what he hides from people and that he is acting before them!""")

t(20, 2140, """“Allah would never wrong them, but it was they who wronged themselves”""")

t(21, 690, """Hajj Minqar: you're bringing me followers from Iran? So should I learn Iranian?""")

t(21, 1775, """He who feels safe from punishment behaves badly""")

t(22, 355, """My darling .. I did not know you loved me this much!""")

t(22, 1425, """I'm afraid you won't come back .. Come back to Syria and I'll give you my channel as a gift""")

t(22, 2530, """A story and a lesson .. Taking lightly the use of visions to spread corruption on earth!!
Relax, man .. there's no danger .. take it easy .. curse as much as you like, don't worry .. What can I swear by to you that he is a charlatan""")

t(23, 90, """and a swindler and a hypocrite and one of the people of the Fire, and he is acting religious before people .. Yes, the visions told me so, man .. The visions told me, by Allah .. Of course .. Do you think I'm playing!""")

t(23, 1225, """When will you come back to me, my darling!""")

t(23, 2310, """I present to you Rida the Tunisian .. He will change your religion for you .. He will replace the month of Ramadan for you .. and he will lead 100 thousand people astray .. They will fast in month 9 .. Do not tremble .. With Rida, Islam is more beautiful .. Welcome, with Rida .. Come on, Rida .. Go .. Go and spread corruption on earth as you wish""")

t(24, 955, """I see .. I believe .. Whoever you hear saying that to you in matters of religion, wash your hand of him .. wash both your hands of him""")

t(24, 2050, """Iskander SS 26""")

t(25, 1660, """In certain countries where people grew up on the culture of manufacturing the limelight .. Egypt .. Lebanon .. Syria .. the Maghreb countries .. Jordan .. Turkey .. Malaysia .. and many other countries .. countries where the limelight is manufactured as an industry, not a hobby .. when a citizen of those countries fails to become something among 100 million people, someone influential in his society, while the worthless one is filmed by the cameras and makes films and millions, the one whose means do not succeed does not withdraw to look after his children, his life and his Hereafter .. Rather he comes out to play the thug on the internet .. or to spread misguidance on the net .. or to become one of the people of evil on the net .. or to commit enormities on earth while laughing .. And one of the greatest kinds of thuggery of these thugs is ((using visions to harm others))! The sheikh in the picture is an adviser .. and the warrior is a punisher .. And these, from my experience with them, are not helped by advice!""")

t(26, 515, """Devils playing with the mind .. hovering around the sinner .. But cardiac arrest is sudden .. it never asks permission""")

t(26, 1600, """Everything that is misused brings harm .. and causes a wrong .. brings a calamity .. and leaves behind something grave .. it produces evil and corruption on earth .. Then, one day, Allah willing, it will surely be cut right off""")

t(27, 175, """The fate of the oppressors, Allah willing""")

t(27, 1300, """Do not take oppression lightly; how many heavy prices have been paid by those who lived oppressing while laughing, being arrogant and haughty! How many a condition changed .. how many a health worsened .. and limbs were paralysed .. and a heart stopped and beat a thousand beats in a single second then died, then went back to work then stopped .. then returned and stopped .. then began to beat and its beating would not quieten, fast, fast, fast .. then he perished without dying .. then the body lay still without a funeral so that the body would taste the torment .. then the bed was his abode .. then his prayers were without bowing or prostration .. then the offspring weep .. and the wife wails .. and the mind can hardly believe what is happening .. and the heart filled with blackness as a punishment from Allah .. and the face turned black! And people forgot .. and the fame went .. and the renown died out .. .. These are some of its consequences in this world .. The picture speaks .. The picture is a reality .. Satan and your own self will tell you: do not care .. Your self will tell you that you are in the right .. and Satan will tell you that you are correct .. while the calamity draws near to you and you do not know .. Supplications in the depth of the night are coming .. They will never be turned back, by the power of Him with whom the supplications of those struck by injustice are not turned back.""")

t(28, 200, """Do not take oppression lightly; how many heavy prices have been paid by those who lived oppressing while laughing, being arrogant and haughty! How many a condition changed .. how many a health worsened .. and limbs were paralysed .. and a heart stopped and beat a thousand beats in a day then went back to work and stopped .. then returned and stopped .. then began to beat and its beating would not quieten .. So those who perished, perished without dying .. and the body of those who lay still, lay still without a funeral to taste the torment .. and the bed was his abode .. and his prayers were without bowing or prostration .. and the offspring weep .. and the wife wails .. and the mind can hardly believe what is happening .. and the heart filled with blackness as a punishment from Allah .. and the face turned black! And people forgot .. and the fame went .. and the renown died out .. .. These are some of its consequences in this world .. The picture speaks .. The picture is a reality .. Satan and your own self will tell you: do not care .. Your self will tell you that you are in the right .. and Satan will tell you that you are correct .. while the calamity draws near to you and you do not know .. Supplications in the depth of the night are coming .. They will never be turned back, by the power of Him with whom the supplications of those struck by injustice are not turned back.""")

t(28, 1640, """A year and a half ago I looked into the eyes of one of them and became certain in my heart of something! I became certain that his companion had led him astray! And I looked into the eye of the other and became certain of something! I became certain that he had led his companion astray! And tomorrow both will know that they led each other astray! Because only what is sound holds true! No evil and obscenity rests on goodness and soundness of heart .. and no boasting and conceit, while ignorance speaks in the eyes and from the mouth, rests on goodness and soundness of heart .. All conceit bequeaths nothing but an illusion of righteousness .. an illusion made by Satan .. And all arrogance .. leads to no good except in the minds of the deluded .. Indeed Allah our Lord does not set right the work of the corrupters .. As for exploiting the platforms to trifle with the records of bad deeds and fill them! And spreading corruption on earth with the tongue .. and harming people and taking harming them lightly, there is nothing in any of this that brings one near to Allah, even if Satan deluded them that all this is nearness to the King!! Rather it is a work of corruption that angers the King, hallowed be His names .. And Satan indeed drives them astray and makes them attach the grave things their tongues utter to “Allah the Almighty our Lord said” and “His Messenger ﷺ said”! And they bring people's visions and interpret them according to what their souls fancy and desire of slandering others, so they neither kept the trust of interpretation about which they will be asked on the Day of Resurrection, nor guarded their records from the rights of servants who will demand from them grave rights on a day when regret is of no use!

This post is for the general lesson .. The two subjects of the post are of one nationality and know each other; both colluded in what Allah will not set their hearts right by .. because Allah the Exalted our Lord does not set right the work of corruption .. And I do not care .. But it is a reminder that does not benefit the arrogant .. nor benefit the extremists .. nor benefit the actors .. Soon, Allah willing, blackened faces will appear more and more after the time has passed .. the time for repenting of harming Allah's servants""")

t(29, 845, """The same person .. in this world .. begins with an artificial purity .. then his reality appears .. The same person in this world .. The same person is born before people pure and humble .. this is how he acts before people .. Then Satan drives him astray .. plays with his mind .. plays with his heart .. fills his heart with ignorance, so his spirit blackens and he hastens to show what he was hiding .. Then his soul blackens before people and is exposed .. An injustice he makes light of and utters as easily as a sip of water .. O Allah, there are people who harm Your servants every night, while Your servants are asleep, unaware, with nothing for them or against them .. O Allah, make the faces of the oppressors blackened before people as a sign from You and a punishment .. O Allah, decree for them among people a humiliation that You do not lift from them until they meet You""")

t(29, 2145, """Blessed are the unwary among men .. like the unwary among women .. They live for Allah, seeking nothing of this world's goods, and it has no share in their hearts .. they await in sincerity the day of departure .. So they are accused by the people of this world and the seekers of money .. they are accused with slander .. Patience, for the pain of the heart, by Allah, is great in Allah's sight, but the oppressors do not know and are not guided, because every creature is eased toward what it was created for, and what it was created for is its own choice .. when it chooses to live to do one single thing in its life .. (how to lose its Hereafter).""")

t(30, 885, """Not everyone who displays religion has taken people to the path of guidance .. The reason: Allah our Lord uses .. He uses the misguided, lost one among people to convey to His servants what they may wish to hear, even if it is not important .. One of the aspects of Allah's power on His earth .. and one of the aspects of Allah the Almighty's subduing of His servants while they do not know, do not realise, do not understand, and would not want it if they realised what is hidden from them .. But the oppressors do not know .. and are not guided!

And this is among the wonders of Allah the Exalted's power over His creation when He subdues them, while their souls are vile, and so uses them for the unwary who have no means .. And among the most wondrous things a person may see and witness on Allah's earth and among His servants are those whom He forcibly compels to do what benefits others; He prepares for the misguided the motives of self and whim so that they utter what benefits others, so that those whom Allah the Exalted wants to know come to know, and the task of the conveyer and carrier ends, then his affair is left to Allah, who does with him what He wills!""")

t(30, 2310, """Learn to light a fire""")

t(32, 465, """Cooking in the world during the Great War""")

t(32, 1565, """Empty, for carrying water""")

t(33, 610, """Two young tigers and an exhausted lion (earthly powers) .. and a moon (a heavenly power) .. And world peace is near, Allah willing""")

t(33, 1500, """A vision 10 years ago .. Many have asked about the safe places in the world during the Great War .. In the vision it was as I tried to render the picture as far as possible, except that the light was more beautiful, whiter .. The mind cannot imagine it because it resembles nothing the eyes see in reality; a serenity covering the place .. angels of light surrounding the whole place, fluttering above the place .. not visible, but their light was clearly the light of angels .. The light was angelic .. And every 3 persons sat in a circle glorifying and remembering Allah the Almighty our Lord .. Among the most beautiful visions of the future .. serenity, calm, beauty and spirituality without equal in the Sacred House .. The light that was above the heads was not an ordinary light .. it was an angelic light .. Some ask me about the coming Great War and the safe places .. The Noble Sanctuary of Makkah is safe, by Allah's permission, even if events occur; yes, events will occur if the narrations from the books of Ahl al-Sunnah are sound, and the Noble Sanctuary of Madinah likewise .. But this vision revealed the security and safety in the Sanctuary of Makkah, and safety in it even if after hard events; but in the end, after the events, this was the scene: serenity, security and spirituality""")

t(34, 145, """It is no longer a grain made into a dome .. the grain of wheat has become a mountain! The amount of inventions on the channels .. The mawlid of their master YouTube .. a mawlid whose host is absent .. A message to the breaking-news channels .. If an apple falls from a tree in Ukraine they busy us with thousands of videos .. and if a kid goat coughs in the Himalaya mountains, thousands of breaking-news videos are made!""")

t(34, 1125, """Arabs who migrated to the West after the end of the Third World War, listening to the news in a Parisian restaurant""")

t(34, 1990, """One of the pictures of the future .. And Allah the Exalted is Most High and knows best .. As came in narrations from the books of Ahl al-Sunnah about the displacement of a great number of people to the West in future times, and they will take their dogs with them!""")

t(35, 400, """Writers, orators and speakers .. Events from the future .. And Allah the Exalted is Most High and knows best .. As came in narrations from the books of Ahl al-Sunnah that dealt with the displacement of many people to the West for varied and different reasons!""")

t(35, 1315, """The voices of evil will fall silent soon, Allah willing .. The voices that spread corruption on earth .. and wreaked havoc on earth, destroying religion and sound thought .. And they will not speak again until the Day of Resurrection""")

t(35, 2235, """Every frustrated brother .. every frustrated sister .. all whose souls were torn by the weight of what befell them .. those who grew up .. in the pit since they became aware .. Here is the news for you, by the power of your Lord .. This time of your freedom, Allah willing, is drawing near .. nearer than you think!""")

t(36, 655, """When you are displaced in Europe and in places of conflict, as happened in the Strip and in many places to come around the world, you must gather around the people of reason, understanding and wisdom and give them room to speak; perhaps in what they say there are benefits for you on the journey of displacement""")

t(36, 2455, """One of the honourable brothers, two days ago, commenting on a picture of a woman cooking on a fire on the balcony of her home, said that charcoal is expensive and we cannot afford to buy it. As I said 4 years ago in the early days of the channel, I said one must own an axe. The picture explains the reason.""")

t(37, 915, """For the displaced exclusively, for filling up on the roads; and suitable for those staying in their homes for carrying drinkable water""")

t(37, 1790, """A filter for purifying and cleaning water that is clean but has impurities, such as running water that is full of dust, or flowing river water that needs purifying of impurities. The filter is available in every country and its price is somewhat high, but it filters 5000 litres per filter; it is fitted inside the iron frame then replaced, and can serve dozens of people and families""")

t(38, 250, """For those settled inside their homes who will not be displaced and will not leave their homes""")

t(38, 1140, """For those settled inside their homes who will not be displaced and leave their homes, where people will stay in their homes, but the water may be cut off for days or weeks""")

t(38, 2040, """In the countries where there will be displacement and leaving of homes, because plastic does not break during transport""")
